# The UI calls its own origin (`/api/...`) and needs no base URL:
# `npm run dev` proxies /api to localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts), and a
# Vercel deployment rewrites /api to the serverless function.
#
# Set this only to point a local UI at an API on another host, e.g.
# VITE_API_URL=https://taptim.vercel.app
# VITE_API_URL=
